	quest.0037C5595753ABAB.quest_desc: ["If you want to be a great &dmage&f of the blood school, this &dstaff&f is perfect for you!"]
	quest.0037C5595753ABAB.quest_subtitle: "&4Blood&f for Blood"
	quest.0038EC3A0FF49CF2.quest_subtitle: "+++ &dAugment&f"
	quest.00654F576522DDCA.quest_desc: [
		"A gearbox with shafts on all 6 sides."
		"Top and bottom spin at half &aspeed&f."
	]
	quest.006A26D253D4D1C2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Jetpack&r is an item that allows the player to fly, equippable in the chestplate slot."
		""
		"It uses &3Hydrogen&r gas as a fuel, of which it can store up to &o&b24,000mB&r."
	]
	quest.00C88180C14B1A91.quest_desc: ["Used with &6Spatial IO Port&r to store spatial regions."]
	quest.0126A0CB0EA92FEA.quest_desc: ["The more we learn about &dmagic&f, the more &bmana&f and faster regeneration speed we can get, meaning it pays off to study!"]
	quest.0126A0CB0EA92FEA.quest_subtitle: "Knowledge!"
	quest.012D2E291C863EA2.quest_desc: ["We can generate &bmana&f from crop &agrowth&f! Self-sustainable."]
	quest.012D2E291C863EA2.quest_subtitle: "Generating with &2Crops&f"
	quest.014731A25F742B51.quest_desc: [
		"Carminite Block is a very curious block. When it receives a &credstone&f signal, it generates temporary blocks in the direction of the redstone signal."
		""
		"While the Carminite Reactor converts surrounding obsidian and netherrack into fake gold and diamond blocks, and if maintained, it will &4explode&f surrounding blocks."
	]
	quest.014731A25F742B51.quest_subtitle: "New Features"
	quest.0149B3F7F08D7E35.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.0178187060C7017A.quest_desc: ["We can &6create&f new types of dirt to speed up the &agrowth&f process of seeds."]
	quest.0178187060C7017A.quest_subtitle: "An &aImproved&f Dirt"
	quest.0221FE72F998600E.quest_subtitle: "A &6Create&f mod add-on adding quality-of-life blocks that you wish existed in Create."
	quest.024D9B3DE796D72C.quest_subtitle: "Cut &2Food&f!"
	quest.026FF42DA59E112A.quest_desc: ["Now our little car needs its 4 wheels."]
	quest.026FF42DA59E112A.quest_subtitle: "THE WHEEL!"
	quest.026FF42DA59E112A.title: "Tire"
	quest.027626898FC07F24.quest_desc: ["Repair with fermented spider eyes."]
	quest.027626898FC07F24.quest_subtitle: "Drain the life of your &cenemies&f"
	quest.02A016C42ED9FD17.quest_desc: ["I dare say that, if worked on properly, using &7Silent Gear&f you can get one of the best &cweapons&f in the modpack!"]
	quest.02A016C42ED9FD17.quest_subtitle: "The Great &ePower&f"
	quest.02BBB7789299DB4D.quest_subtitle: "Carry &3Liquids&f"
	quest.02FF150E01AAA17D.quest_desc: ["Okay, that one is kind of cool, but this one is much better... we can use the crafting terminal to have a crafting table right with the &9system&f, making our life so much &aeasier&f."]
	quest.02FF150E01AAA17D.quest_subtitle: "Improving"
	quest.032ACC1B4A6B105D.quest_desc: ["Connect all your storage to just one block making everything &aeasier&f!"]
	quest.032ACC1B4A6B105D.quest_subtitle: "Connecting"
	quest.0362C6BF5A00D69A.quest_desc: [
		"Looks like we can make new gear in this world!"
		""
		"There is an &aupgrade&f available from &8netherite&f armor to warden armor!"
		""
		"This new &7smithing template&f can be found in &1ancient cities&f."
		""
		"They can be duplicated with seven Diamonds and one Sculk Block!"
	]
	quest.0362C6BF5A00D69A.quest_subtitle: "New Gear"
	quest.03637F996B5254B4.quest_desc: ["EUREKA! We got our first seed. We can plant it in any dirt and it will start &agrowing&f and generating wood &2essence&f."]
	quest.03637F996B5254B4.quest_subtitle: "Our First &2Seed&f"
	quest.036A99380940B4E2.quest_desc: ["&6Create&f is such an incredible mod... it could have &abetter&f armor."]
	quest.036A99380940B4E2.quest_subtitle: "Simple"
	quest.036A99380940B4E2.title: "Copper Diving &7Armor&f"
	quest.039F2117376EA44F.quest_desc: ["Now with the feather, we can construct our map, never get lost again, and locate the next &4bosses&f &aeasier&f!"]
	quest.039F2117376EA44F.quest_subtitle: "Finding Yourself"
	quest.03A0FB89A7D725AA.quest_desc: ["Okay, this &dstaff&f is pretty weird and I only added it because I could not really understand it, so I hope you can."]
	quest.03A0FB89A7D725AA.quest_subtitle: "?"
	quest.03C58AA2E3FC7C70.quest_desc: ["Just kidding, I wish it were, but it really is just a &7shovel&f."]
	quest.03C58AA2E3FC7C70.quest_subtitle: "&7Shovel&f + Xp = Paxel"
	quest.03E48C7049237929.quest_desc: ["This block works just like a reactor and allows us to build a structure by stacking these blocks to increase &agrowth&f &aspeed&f."]
	quest.03E48C7049237929.quest_subtitle: "Speeding Up!"
	quest.040F62621A53E45C.quest_desc: ["We need to &6create&f a &awrench&f for several situations in the mod!"]
	quest.040F62621A53E45C.quest_subtitle: "&aWrench&f"
	quest.04D6679C93D3AA56.quest_desc: [
		"Obviously we could not leave this iconic &7armor&f out..."
		""
		"Refining a bit of obsidian is &aeasier&f than it looks, and this armor is very strong!"
	]
	quest.04D6679C93D3AA56.quest_subtitle: "Refining!"
	quest.04D6679C93D3AA56.title: "Refined Obsidian &7Armor&f"
	quest.04E2D539E33B7B0F.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Infuser combines two &3gases&f to &6create&f another gas. The gas gauges on the left and right side of its GUI are the input tanks, and correspond with the left and right sides of the machine. The gauge in the middle is for the resulting gas, which likewise is output through the front of the machine. The input and output sides can be changed in the UI of the machine."
		""
		"Without any upgrades, it operates using 200 J/t and operates once per tick (according to the recipe's cost and output). Notably, each speed upgrade doubles the operation speed of this machine, for 256 operations/t production rate at maximum upgrades."
	]
	quest.05029712A4D93C57.quest_desc: ["This block works just like a reactor and allows us to build a structure by stacking these blocks to increase &agrowth&f &aspeed&f."]
	quest.05029712A4D93C57.quest_subtitle: "Speeding Up!"
	quest.05421CEF5EFFA4D7.quest_desc: ["The &aSpeed&f &aUpgrade&f increases the transfer speed of the device it is installed in."]
	quest.056592C8FA5E825C.quest_desc: ["Mixing two completely separate worlds into one... make this new &belytra&f."]
	quest.056592C8FA5E825C.quest_subtitle: "A New Style"
	quest.0587E42EC99625A4.quest_desc: ["This occult &7pickaxe&f is clearly not a great choice, but inside &5Occultism&f it is incredible."]
	quest.0587E42EC99625A4.quest_subtitle: "Occult &dMagic&f"
	quest.058B25A10A3994BD.quest_desc: ["Get the items of the &6Sun&f God, but be &ccareful&f not to get burned."]
	quest.058B25A10A3994BD.quest_subtitle: "&6Sun&f Key"
	quest.058D0BFB38F8ABF4.quest_subtitle: "Is it good to eat this?"
	quest.05ADC7C5B23CA991.title: "&5Utherium&f Armor"
	quest.05C553FAA991CDDE.quest_desc: ["Now we need to travel 1000 blocks away from &5the End&f island. Use the portal to make it easier to find an &5End City&f, where we can find an End Ship and locate the elytra."]
	quest.05C553FAA991CDDE.quest_subtitle: "Chasing the &bElytra&f"
	quest.05C553FAA991CDDE.title: "&5End City&f"
	quest.05C956C3A601B1B8.quest_desc: ["We can stick to the conventional and enchant our &7pickaxe&f all the way to Efficiency 10!"]
	quest.05C956C3A601B1B8.quest_subtitle: "Keeping It Conventional"
	quest.05CF6F54E85C7870.quest_desc: ["All multiblock &9machines&f need the core to function. The &abetter&f the core, the better it will perform its role! Place it on the ground and set the core blocks where indicated. This is an upgraded version of the pulverizer."]
	quest.05CF6F54E85C7870.quest_subtitle: "Our First Multiblock"
	quest.0610F12986F75E8A.quest_desc: ["These fruits are perfect for creating new &dArs Nouveau&f potions."]
	quest.0610F12986F75E8A.quest_subtitle: "New Foods"
	quest.0610F12986F75E8A.title: "Berries"
	quest.06779070831505CB.quest_subtitle: "&bIce&f School Armor"
	quest.06779070831505CB.title: "Cryomancer &7Armor&f"
	quest.06CB12F1A331DB33.quest_desc: ["Now that we traded, we can trade until we get an &5ender&f pearl and then go after the &4nether&f fortress."]
	quest.06CB12F1A331DB33.quest_subtitle: "Trade the &6gold&f"
	quest.06CB12F1A331DB33.title: "Trades"
	quest.072E50F983AB7FC2.quest_desc: [
		"This &2essence&f of &alife&f is peaceful (as incredible as it sounds)."
		""
		"Using it in the off-hand will fertilize crops, &aheal&f nearby players and tamed animals."
		""
		"In addition to removing bad effects from the player."
	]
	quest.072E50F983AB7FC2.quest_subtitle: "Taking Care of &2Plants&f"
	quest.074D315D115A629C.quest_desc: [
		"With this new table we can get &bgems&f and materials without using the &7anvil&f."
		""
		"You can recycle tools and armor and, of course, what you get is always based on the item rarity."
	]
	quest.074D315D115A629C.quest_subtitle: "Getting &7Dust&f More Easily"
	quest.075A2E8C84FF52BD.quest_subtitle: "This might actually be useful I think"
	quest.075DA793A99F7371.quest_desc: ["Want to pull a &esocket&f out of your tool? Relax, this &dsigil&f does that for you!"]
	quest.075DA793A99F7371.quest_subtitle: "Throwing It Away"
	quest.075E97B2BB5F93DF.quest_desc: ["Items cannot be added or removed by the player, but by components such as Chutes, Funnels, and Item Hatches."]
	quest.0778D39413088AD2.quest_desc: [
		"You need to find the Lich in his tower."
		""
		"His fight consists of 3 stages: he plays with his shields and scepters, and finally switches to his &6golden&f sword and enters a fury!"
		""
		"{entity:twilightforest:lich ent_size:1.0 off_x:0.0 off_y:0.0 rot:0.0 spin:FORCE_OFF idle:FORCE_ON walk:FORCE_OFF width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0778D39413088AD2.quest_subtitle: "The Wizard!"
	quest.07AD45DCF9EE3C2E.quest_desc: [
		"&9Tier Installers&r are used to upgrade various machines into their &3Factory&r equivalent."
		""
		"&aRight-click&r on the machine with the &9Tier Installer&r and it will upgrade that machine to a &3Factory&r - its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the &9Factory Installer&r used."
		""
		"&aBasic Tier Installers&r can be used on any machine that has a &3Factory&r associated with it that has not yet been turned into one."
		""
		"However, &4Advanced Tier Installers&r can only be used on &aBasic Factories&r, while &9Elite Tier Installers&r can only be used on &4Advanced Factories&r, and &dUltimate Tier Installers&r can only be used on &9Elite Factories&r."
		""
		"This is intended so that the player does not &nskip any tiers&r in the &b&oupgrade chain&r, e.g. going from &aBasic Factory&r to &dUltimate Factory&r instantly."
	]
	quest.07D7452998CD707E.quest_subtitle: "Level 5"
	quest.07E90BC8F9AF58A5.quest_desc: ["This &ccrossbow&f is clearly an end game item, and even unenchanted it is perfect."]
	quest.07E90BC8F9AF58A5.quest_subtitle: "Ok..."
	quest.07EF8ABA0027BB91.quest_desc: [
		"Required to &6create&f a connection between two Quantum &9Network&f Bridges, they are always produced in matching pairs. To create a connection place 1 of the pair of quantum entangled singularities into the ME Quantum Link Chamber of the bridge on each side."
		""
		"They are crafted by causing a reaction between &5Ender&f Pearl or Ender Dust"
		"and a Singularity. Any explosive force should be enough to trigger the reaction."
	]
	quest.0890EC93719E5249.quest_desc: ["Now let's step up the level a bit, grab some &7iron&f! Let's officially start this game."]
	quest.0890EC93719E5249.quest_subtitle: "Level Up"
	quest.0890EC93719E5249.title: "&7Iron&f"
	quest.089146D14FA66D46.quest_desc: ["Traveling to the Warden's &5dimension&f, we can make this beautiful and perfect &csword&f!"]
	quest.089146D14FA66D46.quest_subtitle: "Deep And Darker"
	quest.08BBC9831199DC5D.quest_subtitle: "Level 10"
	quest.08DDE018A804BFE7.quest_desc: [
		"This &9machine&f uses &eenergy&f to extract dusts out of certain blocks and ores, making it essential to producing different kinds of tools. Not to be mistaken with the Crusher, this machine is the pulverizer equivalent in other mods."
		""
		"Can also be used to turn Coal or Charcoal into Compressed Carbon, &cRedstone&f into Compressed Redstone, Diamond into Compressed Diamond and Refined Obsidian Dust into Compressed Obsidian, all for use in the Metallurgic Infuser."
		""
		"Note: Compressed Carbon is worth 100 carbon; Coal is worth 10 and Charcoal is worth 20; hence it is better to refine coal and use Compressed Carbon."
	]
	quest.08DDE018A804BFE7.quest_subtitle: "Breaks Raw Ores into Dusts"
	quest.093D6740039903A1.quest_desc: [
		"This is the first &erarity&f, the &7common&f one, and of course it is the weakest."
		""
		"It shows up when your world tier is: Haven"
	]
	quest.093D6740039903A1.quest_subtitle: "&7Common&f"
	quest.09408C6DCAC90318.quest_desc: [
		"An &4Energy Cube&r is an advanced type of battery that is compatible with multiple energy systems."
		""
		"&cEnergy&r can be input from &o&b5&r sides, and output on &o&b1&r side. The output side has a special marking which looks like a &nsmall panel&r."
		""
		"Rotate the Cube by &eright-clicking&r with a &awrench&r."
		""
		"&4Energy Cubes&r can be transported by &ashift-right-clicking&r with a &ewrench&r. This will “break” the Cube, but all its energy will be &nsafely stored inside&r."
		""
		"When the Cube is in your &einventory&r, &nholding shift&r will display additional data about the Cube’s energy level."
	]
	quest.094F02F3D3D5F8F8.quest_desc: ["We will use the pulverizer for several things in the mod, including duplicating ores! It is our first real &9machine&f in the mod."]
	quest.094F02F3D3D5F8F8.quest_subtitle: "Pulverizing Everything"
	quest.095223210FCC48C3.quest_desc: ["We need the Wheel Mount to put on our car; it will make the wheel axles rotate. You can also change the wheel suspension by configuring them by clicking on the axle."]
	quest.095223210FCC48C3.quest_subtitle: "Wheel axle"
	quest.095223210FCC48C3.title: "Wheel Mount"
	quest.0959A5F4A7AB4F0D.quest_desc: ["If you like heat, the &6Fire&f School is definitely for you!"]
	quest.0959A5F4A7AB4F0D.quest_subtitle: "&6Fire&f School"
	quest.095E1C928584FAAC.quest_desc: [
		"&9Free Runners&r are an item that allows players to ascend 1-block inclines automatically (like the Horse), as well as preventing &cfall damage&r as long as they are charged. A fall will reduce the item's charge, depending on how far the fall was."
		""
		"&9Free Runners&r can be charged inside of various power-related generators or storage devices, like the &aAdvanced Solar Generator&r or the &2Energy Cube&r."
	]
	quest.099D288598DBDB0E.quest_desc: ["This school is quite curious, they studied entity summoning. Cool, right? It can help you with many factors and farms."]
	quest.099D288598DBDB0E.quest_subtitle: "Evocation School"
	quest.09BE3D92053AE1F8.quest_desc: ["When attempting to place the Roller on the top face of a block, it will be placed one block above it, similarly to a &9Mechanical&f Mixer or Mechanical Press. Though it appears to take up a few blocks of space, it only takes up one. There is also Placement Assist functionality, allowing for easy placement of Rollers to either of two sides of a roller. The Roller can be picked up by sneak using a &aWrench&f on it."]
	quest.0AA59318133727FA.quest_desc: [
		"This sanctuary is very different. Hold your breath when entering and bring some apples!"
		""
		"Entering the sanctuary, we need to survive as long as possible. Purple thorns will try to kill you at all costs!"
	]
	quest.0AA59318133727FA.quest_subtitle: "Life or &4Death&f"
	quest.0AA707B8D11B7254.quest_desc: [
		"In this modpack of ours, there are several new mods and new mechanics. We can divide them into a few categories, such as:"
		""
		"- Vanilla"
		"- &9Technology&f and &eEnergy&f"
		"- &6Create&f"
		"- &dMagic&f"
		"- RPG"
		"- Exploration"
		"- Structures and Dungeons"
		"- &2Farming&f and &2Food&f"
		"- Animals and Creatures"
		"- Building and Decoration"
		"- Bosses, Dimensions, and Challenges"
		""
		"Ok, I know it is a lot of stuff, let's take it easy hahaha or else we will go crazy!"
	]
	quest.0AA707B8D11B7254.quest_subtitle: "Key mods"
	quest.0AECD81D00CC05CF.quest_desc: [
		"This &dsigil&f is the key to good gear and tools!"
		""
		"Keep plenty of these sigils around, because everything consumes them!"
	]
	quest.0AECD81D00CC05CF.quest_subtitle: "The Key"
	quest.0AEDFC064B84C877.quest_desc: [
		"Autocrafting is one of the primary functions of AE2. Instead of manually having to craft the correct number of each sub-ingredient and labor away like some sort of plebian, you can ask your ME system to do it for you. Or automatically craft items and export them somewhere. Or automatically keep certain amounts of items in stock through clever emergent behavior. It also works with &3fluids&f, and, if you have certain addons for extra mod material types, like &9Mekanism&f gasses, those materials too. It's pretty great."
		""
		"It is quite a complex topic, so strap in and let's go."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"An autocrafting setup consists of 3 things:"
		""
		"The thing sending the crafting re\tquest"
		"The crafting CPU"
		"The ME Pattern Provider."
		"Here is what happens:"
		""
		"Something creates a crafting re\tquest. This can be you in the terminal clicking on something autocraftable, or an export bus or interface with a crafting card re\tquesting one of the item they're set to export/stock."
		"(IMPORTANT: use whatever you have bound to \"pick block\" (usually middle-mouse) to re\tquest crafts of something you already have in stock, this can conflict with inventory sorting mods),"
		"The ME system calculates the required ingredients and prerequisite crafting steps to fulfill the re\tquest, and stores them in the selected crafting CPU"
		""
		"The ME Pattern Provider with the relevant pattern pushes the ingredients specified in the pattern to any adjacent inventory. In the case of a crafting table recipe (a \"crafting pattern\") this will be a Molecular Assembler. In the case of a non-crafting recipe (a \"processing pattern\") this will be some other block or machine or elaborate redstone-controlled setup."
		""
		"The result of the craft is returned to the system somehow, be it by import bus, interface, or pushing the result back into a pattern provider. Note that an \"item entering system\" event must occur, you can't just pipe the result into a chest with a ME Storage Bus on it."
		""
		"If that craft is a prerequisite for another craft in the re\tquest, the items are stored in that crafting CPU and then used in that craft."
	]
	quest.0B3E66D968FACB60.quest_desc: ["We can &6create&f an &3oxygen&f tank to store oxygen and stay safe! To fill it, simply place it in the machine's oxygen slot."]
	quest.0B3E66D968FACB60.quest_subtitle: "Saving a Bit for Later"
	quest.0B6A77DC348C6324.quest_desc: ["This little darling is so wanted by &9Mekanism&f lovers! Simply an incredible tool!"]
	quest.0B6A77DC348C6324.quest_subtitle: "The Long-Awaited One"
	quest.0B6D2CCFD879E961.quest_desc: [
		"Resting in her sanctuary, we find the Valkyrie..."
		""
		"However, to face her, we need to show our &epower&f: eliminate 10 Valkyries in the sanctuary until reaching the queen."
		""
		"{entity:aether:valkyrie_queen ent_size:1.0 off_x:0.0 off_y:0.0 rot:0.0 spin:USE_GLOBAL idle:FORCE_OFF walk:FORCE_ON width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0B6D2CCFD879E961.quest_subtitle: "Goddess of War"
	quest.0B76987996232354.quest_desc: [
		"In our modpack we have several new types of &7armor&f."
		""
		"And from several mods, each one with a different attribute and a different feel!"
	]
	quest.0B76987996232354.quest_subtitle: "&aLearn&f a Bit About Every Armor"
	quest.0B76987996232354.title: "Armors"
	quest.0BB72E1B23B46C81.quest_desc: ["The &8catacombs&f are an underground structure that hides many mysteries..."]
	quest.0BB72E1B23B46C81.quest_subtitle: "New Structure"
	quest.0BBE6CADED48A971.quest_desc: [
		"Click a Stock Link with the Stock Ticker to connect it to that &9network&f. Place a Mob in a Seat or a &6Blaze&f Burner behind the Stock Ticker to turn it into a Stock Keeper."
		""
		"The Stock Keeper can see all the items on the network. The UI displays how many Stock Links are connected. If the Stock Keeper is left unlocked, players can search the network, re\tquest items, and give their re\tquests an Address to be sent to."
		""
		"If the Stock Keeper is locked, other players will not be able to access its UI. The Stock Keeper will still be able to accept Shopping Lists."
	]
	quest.0C1F5E0528669A3A.quest_desc: ["For certain fights a &cbow&f is the best option, and the Electric Bow is certainly one of the best."]
	quest.0C1F5E0528669A3A.quest_subtitle: "&9Mekanism&f"
	quest.0C2E65EDF155F576.quest_desc: [
		"Walking through the &bAether&f we can find a new friend named Moa, perfect for riding among the clouds."
		""
		""
		"{entity:aether:moa ent_size:1.0 off_x:0.0 off_y:0.0 rot:0.0 spin:USE_GLOBAL idle:USE_GLOBAL walk:FORCE_ON width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0C2E65EDF155F576.quest_subtitle: "A New Mount"
	quest.0C377B1DDE16DFEA.quest_desc: [
		"I believe everyone already knows how to make the &5portal&f to the &bAether&f, right?"
		""
		"For those who don't, it is very simple: take 14 glowstone blocks, build it in a nether portal shape, and light it with a water bucket."
	]
	quest.0C377B1DDE16DFEA.quest_subtitle: "Creating the &5Portal&f"
	quest.0C377B1DDE16DFEA.title: "Glowstone"
	quest.0C51D58AC8EAF27C.quest_subtitle: "Copper &aupgrade&f"
	quest.0CEE9CB251DA3F89.quest_desc: ["This monster is clearly not pleasant at all, and it only wants to make our &alife&f harder."]
	quest.0CEE9CB251DA3F89.quest_subtitle: "Mega Bat"
	quest.0D60DFFEBAAB1409.quest_desc: ["We can use various &aupgrades&f on our backpacks! Check some of them above, almost all have available upgrades."]
	quest.0D60DFFEBAAB1409.quest_subtitle: "&aUpgrades&f"
	quest.0D6CFF6BF44EFAF9.quest_desc: [
		"Do you think cold can be a good choice? Then choose the &bIce&f School!"
		""
		"Find and eliminate a Stray."
	]
	quest.0D6CFF6BF44EFAF9.quest_subtitle: "&bIce&f School"
	quest.0DC58391C0877F34.quest_desc: ["As a drop from the queen, we can obtain a new type of bow: the Tri-Bow fires 3 arrows at once."]
	quest.0DC58391C0877F34.quest_subtitle: "3 in 1"
	quest.0DD41F4672B86716.quest_desc: ["This mob is small and weaker than the others, but it is still really annoying!"]
	quest.0DD41F4672B86716.quest_subtitle: "Small"
	quest.0E1FAAF2D5EEB120.quest_subtitle: "Our Eldritch &dMagic&f"
	quest.0E2EA640E724B51C.quest_desc: ["This beautiful &bAether&f armor is one of the strongest in the game, and it looks amazing! Defeat the &bvalkyries&f and get into the hidden chest."]
	quest.0E2EA640E724B51C.quest_subtitle: "Prove Your Worth"
	quest.0E2EA640E724B51C.title: "&bValkyrie&f Armor"
	quest.0E580153F1936699.quest_desc: ["A powerful &9machine&f that converts excess energy or items into stored matter. It’s essential for producing singularities and other high-tier materials used in advanced storage and &9automation&f systems."]
	quest.0E5FC39E6C71A872.quest_desc: ["The shaft is a basic &9mechanical&f component in &6Create&f. A shaft can be used to connect two mechanical components such that the rotation of one rotates the other, and shafts serve as the only blocks upon which Mechanical Belts can be placed."]
	quest.0E5FC39E6C71A872.title: "Shaft"
	quest.0E9258C07CDD7385.quest_desc: [
		"A &aWrench&f made of Certus Quartz Crystal or &4Nether&f Quartz."
		""
		"Useful for rotating blocks, and removing individual parts from Cables."
	]
	quest.0E9258C07CDD7385.quest_subtitle: "Little &aWrench&f"
	quest.0EDBB50F1C2AD495.quest_subtitle: "&eLightning&f School Armor"
	quest.0EDBB50F1C2AD495.title: "Electromancer &7Armor&f"
	quest.0EE2E9EB6DC01E34.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.0EE7C12766C3CA1B.quest_subtitle: "{ftb\tquests.chapter.mystical_agriculture.questEE7C12766C3CA1B.subtitle}"
	quest.0EE7C12766C3CA1B.title: "{ftb\tquests.chapter.mystical_agriculture.questEE7C12766C3CA1B.title}"
	quest.0EEA8C33BC327CCA.quest_desc: ["The Pattern Access Terminal serves to solve a specific issue: in a dense tower of ME Pattern Providers and Molecular Assemblers, you can't physically access the providers to insert new patterns. Additionally, perhaps you're lazy and don't want to walk across your base to insert a pattern. The pattern access terminal allows access to all pattern providers on the &9network&f."]
	quest.0EEDD09F6D523B09.quest_desc: [
		"Now we can truly fly... or maybe not, we will discover new, much more practical ways to fly... but obviously, there is a cost: $100 dollars, please send it to our PayPal."
		""
		"..."
		""
		"Okay, you didn't fall for it... oh well, grab this &belytra&f and craft some rockets."
	]
	quest.0EEDD09F6D523B09.quest_subtitle: "Officially &bFlying&f"
	quest.0EEF2DFBC15B403C.quest_desc: ["Let's heat up some of this &7iron&f and gather a bit more to make &7armor&f."]
	quest.0EEF2DFBC15B403C.quest_subtitle: "&6FIRE&f!"
	quest.0F49BEFD3A1FD34E.quest_subtitle: "Use for Epic Scrolls"
	quest.0F550A972D2CC175.quest_desc: ["To build balloons, we will need the hot air from this &9machine&f! It is not very cool to put &6fire&f on a netherrack, it might not work!"]
	quest.0F550A972D2CC175.quest_subtitle: "Balloons"
	quest.0FB7D7AC72AE6D50.quest_desc: ["This &csword&f is one of the most nostalgic ones in Minecraft; it could not come from any mod other than &5Twilight&f!"]
	quest.0FB7D7AC72AE6D50.quest_subtitle: "Ooh Ooh &6Fire&f"
	quest.102CF094A4802F63.quest_desc: ["Repair with &5ender&f pearls."]
	quest.102CF094A4802F63.quest_subtitle: "Shoot &5Ender&f Balls"
	quest.107E3B999D5349F6.quest_desc: [
		"We will need to kill some blazes to get &6blaze&f rods and turn them into blaze powder."
		""
		"{entity:minecraft:blaze ent_size:1.0 off_x:0.0 off_y:0.0 rot:0.0 spin:FORCE_OFF idle:USE_GLOBAL walk:FORCE_ON width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.107E3B999D5349F6.quest_subtitle: "Gathering rods"
	quest.107E3B999D5349F6.title: "&6Blaze&f"
	quest.10BA65A8EEDE55C7.quest_desc: [
		"Now we need to refine our crude oil and turn it into fuel."
		""
		"If oil is present in the first tank and the block is powered, the oil will be transferred into fuel."
		""
		"The top-right slot has two functions:"
		""
		"Placing a bucket fills the bucket with fuel."
		"Placing a JetSuit Chestplate fills the JetSuit Chestplate with fuel."
	]
	quest.10BA65A8EEDE55C7.quest_subtitle: "Refining the Fuel"
	quest.10DEC2FDF8445CD2.quest_desc: [
		"&dSigils&f are perfect for getting stronger and stronger in &dApotheosis&f."
		""
		"Each one has its own unique property that can help us, clearing &esockets&f or even adding socket slots."
		""
		"To use one, just put your item + the sigil in a Smithing Table, Reforging Table or Augmenting Table."
	]
	quest.10DEC2FDF8445CD2.quest_subtitle: "&dSigils&f and More Sigils"
	quest.10F88408890EE787.quest_desc: [
		"&eBumblezone&f is a mod that deals with bees in a unique way..."
		""
		"We can enter inside their beehive and explore the world from within!"
	]
	quest.10F88408890EE787.quest_subtitle: "Traveling to the Beehive"
	quest.10F88408890EE787.title: "&eBumblezone&f"
	quest.1112E4E2CCEB2467.quest_desc: [
		"So now, you should have 5 &9machines&f ready to go to process your Ores. "
		""
		"Your factory should be something like this:"
		"Chemical Injection Chamber to Purifying Chamber to Crusher to Enrichment Chamber to Smelter."
	]
	quest.113703AE28D9117D.quest_desc: ["Now that we have several &9machines&f, we need better &epower&f; use a lava generator."]
	quest.113703AE28D9117D.quest_subtitle: "Better &ePower&f"
	quest.116AAD169E0E0C34.quest_subtitle: "Basic -> Copper"
	quest.117ADD26D7D46EF9.quest_subtitle: "Place a Gravitite Ore in the Enchanter with an Ambrosium Shard"
	quest.118405B92F73DE7D.quest_desc: ["This little monster is really annoying and will keep spitting at you! So watch out for its &2poison&f."]
	quest.118405B92F73DE7D.quest_subtitle: "Spit"
	quest.11D678E764212CE6.quest_desc: ["We are going to use &7dust&f for almost everything in &dApotheosis&f."]
	quest.11D678E764212CE6.quest_subtitle: "The Base of the Mod"
	quest.11F7FFA9D8C5926C.quest_desc: ["We can find this new &7ore&f in the new &bice&f biomes of the mod."]
	quest.11F7FFA9D8C5926C.quest_subtitle: "Ice &7Ore&f"
	quest.121C9B882D9C5BFB.quest_desc: ["Oh boy, this &7armor&f is controversial. A lot of people love this mod, others though..."]
	quest.121C9B882D9C5BFB.quest_subtitle: "Fishing"
	quest.121C9B882D9C5BFB.title: "Neptunium &7Armor&f"
	quest.124183C99A493097.quest_desc: [
		"This critter is here too?"
		""
		"These critters can only be found in flowering &2forest&f biomes!"
	]
	quest.124183C99A493097.quest_subtitle: "&2Slime&f?"
	quest.128869BB929AD32E.quest_desc: ["With Yeti fur, we can craft a new &7armor&f set."]
	quest.128869BB929AD32E.quest_subtitle: "Snow &7Armor&f"
	quest.128869BB929AD32E.title: "Yeti &7Armor&f"
	quest.12B845C32E284778.quest_desc: ["I have never seen such a bizarre &4nether&f! Finding a fortress quickly is great... use that compass, it helps a lot."]
	quest.12B845C32E284778.quest_subtitle: "We Need to Be Fast"
	quest.12B845C32E284778.title: "Fortress"
	quest.12C6DA9694916E9E.quest_subtitle: "Our Nature &dMagic&f"
	quest.130B1C1D9D50A0DF.quest_desc: ["This table is identical to the previous one, but better, letting us get epic and &5mythic&f &daffixes&f!"]
	quest.130B1C1D9D50A0DF.quest_subtitle: "Epic and Mythic &dAffixes&f"
	quest.131B087E7BB11953.quest_desc: ["Hello aeronaut! Hold on, not yet! Fasten your seatbelts because we are leaving this planet to discover things never seen before! This is Stellaris."]
	quest.131B087E7BB11953.quest_subtitle: "Traveling Between Worlds!"
	quest.131B087E7BB11953.title: "Stellaris"
	quest.135E27A19B935CD7.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click the chain of a Chain Conveyor to set the frogport’s target, then place the frogport. Frogports can be placed up to 4 blocks to the side and down from their target chain."
		""
		"The frogport will only take packages that match its address. The address can be set by right-clicking the placed frogport or in its UI."
		""
		"The frogport will only send packages that don’t match its address unless it is set to “only send packages” in its UI."
	]
	quest.13A8DEE85E9332F9.quest_desc: [
		"With this &2essence&f in our off-hand, we become much smarter!"
		""
		"Entities around us will glow along with chests!"
	]
	quest.13A8DEE85E9332F9.quest_subtitle: "Get Smarter"
	quest.13B9F6081AE64107.quest_desc: ["This incredible armor is part of &9Oritech&f. Oritech is already an incredible mod and its armor is even more so, it is worth &alearning&f about."]
	quest.13B9F6081AE64107.quest_subtitle: "&9Oritech&f"
	quest.13B9F6081AE64107.title: "Exo &7Armor&f"
	quest.13E5A31D115F3176.quest_desc: ["Now we have it! The highly desired... okay, maybe in such a big modpack it isn't THAT desired... but the drama is still fun."]
	quest.13E5A31D115F3176.quest_subtitle: "Beautiful"
	quest.1404BD20F53E3F00.quest_desc: ["We can craft this altar which is the heart of the mod! With it, we can make almost all recipes. Place 8 Pedestals around it and it always requires a &credstone&f pulse!"]
	quest.1404BD20F53E3F00.quest_subtitle: "Crafting Everything!"
	quest.140DE53DC0FCD9F4.quest_desc: [
		"The Annihilation Plane breaks blocks and picks up items. It works similarly to an ME Import Bus, pushing things into &9network&f storage. For items to be picked up, they must collide with the face of the plane, it does not pick up in an area."
		""
		"Annihilation planes can be enchanted with any pickaxe &denchantment&f, so yes, you can put crazy levels of fortune on a few and &9automate&f ore processing if your modpack allows it. In addition, silk touch does what you'd expect it to, efficiency reduces the energy cost of breaking a block, and unbreaking gives a chance of not using any energy."
		""
		"REMEMBER TO ENABLE FAKE PLAYERS IN YOUR CHUNK CLAIM"
	]
	quest.141BD9E06189A5FD.quest_desc: [
		"The cable connects storage &9network&f devices."
		""
		"However, cables are not always required - devices in direct contact will &9automatically&f form a connection."
		""
		"If the cable is colored, it will only connect to blocks and cables of the same color or default color."
	]
	quest.1435B1355E7AEE43.quest_desc: ["We can grab the queen's &2hoe&f."]
	quest.1435B1355E7AEE43.quest_subtitle: "&bAether&f"
	quest.147FC2959F9FC5F5.quest_desc: [
		"Trains are Contraptions that travel on Train Tracks."
		""
		"Assembly"
		"Place the track and right-click it with a station block. Place the station block near the track."
		""
		"Right click on the station and select \"Create Train\" to enter assembly mode (blue flag shown on station)."
		""
		"Place one or more Train Casings on the track where indicated with blue. The casings will turn into bogeys."
		""
		"When assembled, each bogey will &9automatically&f become coupled together as part of the train."
		" "
		"Place a Train Controls block facing the direction dictated by the station. Place a Seat or &6Blaze&f Burner behind the controls for the driver."
		""
		"Use Block Attachment Utilities such as Super Glue to connect all parts together (green highlight)."
		""
		"When finished, use the Station's interface to attempt to assemble the Train. If a Train fails to assemble, an error will be shown in the Station's interface. Common errors are detailed below."
	]
	quest.149EF4451D962A39.quest_desc: [
		"Unlike the yellow sanctuary, in this sanctuary there is a &4boss&f..."
		""
		"Entering the sanctuary, we can go down to the humid sewers and find Boss Rootmin."
		""
		"His fight is complex and &cdifficult&f: jump from platform to platform and bounce back the pellets!"
	]
	quest.149EF4451D962A39.quest_subtitle: "An Intense Fight"
	quest.14A8580C165A2ABD.quest_desc: ["Apotheosis is clearly a great option when we want good tools. Everything starts with a gem; they drop from mobs and it's always good to have a solid amount of them."]
	quest.14A8580C165A2ABD.quest_subtitle: "The hidden side"
	quest.14D2CE1EC45891D1.quest_subtitle: "????"
	quest.14DB9AE08EA64C27.quest_desc: ["To travel now, place our rocket on the launch pad and fuel it up, always bring a bit extra! Get on the rocket, fasten your seatbelts (and press spacebar), and away we go!"]
	quest.14DB9AE08EA64C27.quest_subtitle: "Starting the Journey"
	quest.14E7AAC52584B1A8.quest_desc: [
		"The forgotten &7ore&f..."
		""
		"This new ore can only be obtained by looting the chests in the &8catacombs&f."
		""
		"You are also going to need the &7smithing template&f."
	]
	quest.14E7AAC52584B1A8.quest_subtitle: "Sad"
	quest.153E246F1CB779E1.quest_desc: [
		"We know that not every &bgem&f is going to be appealing."
		""
		"That is why we need to build this table; with it we can swap out the gems we do not like!"
		""
		"For that you just need two identical gems!"
	]
	quest.153E246F1CB779E1.quest_subtitle: "Cycling"
	quest.1583C85390362BB4.quest_desc: ["Until now our car only goes forward and backward; for this, we need to use the &credstone&f signal to turn the car's wheel. We can use a redstone link. We need to put 4 links on the wheel mount, always on the front wheels. Place 2 levers on each and leave it in receiver mode; &eremember&f to invert the sides of each redstone link so the wheel turns in the correct direction."]
	quest.1583C85390362BB4.quest_subtitle: "Controlling the direction"
	quest.1583C85390362BB4.title: "&cRedstone&f Link"
	quest.158749863E32A526.quest_desc: ["This disgusting monster is passive and leaves &2slime&f wherever it goes!"]
	quest.158749863E32A526.quest_subtitle: "Slugs"
	quest.15B8B7FD1C0C2B45.quest_desc: ["Great &7shovel&f, it is just gross to go after it."]
	quest.15B8B7FD1C0C2B45.quest_subtitle: "Perfect and Gross"
	quest.15F39A2D1CA6FD0F.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2"
	quest.15FD01D1340D2A01.quest_desc: [
		"Hello explorer! This new challenge touches on the hidden side of &dmagic&f! Something supernatural, but VERY cool! Let's learn more about &5Occultism&f."
		""
		"We will work with demons that duplicate ores and much more!"
	]
	quest.15FD01D1340D2A01.quest_subtitle: "Occult &dMagic&f!"
	quest.15FD01D1340D2A01.title: "&5Occultism&f"
	quest.1610C8F55F59E82F.quest_desc: [
		"The Quartz Fiber."
		""
		"A part designed to share &eenergy&f between two ME Networks without sharing anything else, also used to craft Fluix ME Glass Cable."
	]
	quest.162CE44400A63575.quest_desc: [
		"The Metallurgic Infuser is the first step in the &9Mekanism&f tech tree. The Metallurgic Infuser is a machine used in the production of &3Steel&f Ingots, Bronze Ingot, Enriched Alloy, and Obsidian Ingots."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Infusing"
		"In the purple slot the infusion material can be inserted, depending on the recipe for the item you are creating:"
		""
		"&cRedstone&f (Redstone, Block of Redstone or Enriched Redstone)"
		"&bDiamond&f (Diamond &7Dust&f or Enriched Diamond)"
		"&8Obsidian&f (Refined Obsidian Dust or Enriched Obsidian)"
		"Carbon (Coal/Charcoal or Enriched Carbon)"
		"Tin (Tin Dust or Enriched Tin)"
		"Bio Fuel (Bio Fuel)"
		"Mushroom (Red or Brown Mushrooms)"
	]
	quest.162CE44400A63575.quest_subtitle: "The Starting &9Machine&f"
	quest.1647DBD333349B8B.quest_desc: [
		"To get perfect &daffixes&f, you need this table."
		""
		"To make it even &abetter&f, use an Augmenting &dSigil&f!"
		""
		"And with that you can already pick the affix you want on your tool, with no restrictions."
	]
	quest.1647DBD333349B8B.quest_subtitle: "Perfection"
	quest.1669A2FBB2735935.quest_desc: ["This basic one works REALLY well!"]
	quest.1669A2FBB2735935.quest_subtitle: "Keeping It Basic"
	quest.1682525DB2C0528E.title: "Forgotten Tools"
	quest.16921CC7956A5C02.quest_desc: ["This school is very curious... we don't know much about it, only that the responsible students vanished and left some strange scrolls behind... They say whoever seeks to &alearn&f discovers what they never should have known."]
	quest.16921CC7956A5C02.quest_subtitle: "Eldritch School"
	quest.16E2C5B6C65F40C9.quest_subtitle: "Use for Legendary Scrolls"
	quest.16EB9D811CED9931.quest_desc: [
		"Okay, let's go. Now that you explored and collected some scrolls, place them in your grimoire and let's cast them. You need to configure a keybind for each &dspell&f in controls for &aeasier&f use."
		""
		"You can upgrade your books up to diamond tier. Afterwards, for new unique books, you need to kill specific monsters for a chance to drop the book."
	]
	quest.16EB9D811CED9931.quest_subtitle: "A New Book"
	quest.17015CD9041B73EE.quest_desc: [
		"Exploring the map, you will find a 3-headed monster isolated in a swamp."
		""
		"Ranged attacks do not work on the Hydra. Defeat one head at a time, but it regenerates them, so &agrow&f strong!"
		""
		"{entity:twilightforest:hydra ent_size:1.0 off_x:0.0 off_y:0.0 rot:0.0 spin:FORCE_OFF idle:FORCE_OFF walk:FORCE_ON width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.17015CD9041B73EE.quest_subtitle: "A 3-Headed Monster"
	quest.174C69594E0D50D3.quest_desc: [
		"Lost in this world, after defeating the Yeti, we can enter the famous glacier biome."
		""
		"We can also find a palace, called the Aurora Palace."
		""
		"Upon arriving, we can face her. Her fight is incredibly &cdifficult&f with various challenges and &bice&f attacks."
		""
		"Reflect her own attacks to strike her!"
		""
		"{entity:twilightforest:snow_queen ent_size:1.0 off_x:0.0 off_y:0.0 rot:0.0 spin:FORCE_OFF idle:USE_GLOBAL walk:FORCE_OFF width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.174C69594E0D50D3.quest_subtitle: "Goddess of &bIce&f"
	quest.175F2B62A150EBA7.quest_subtitle: "Capture Entities"
	quest.177C0E37A35A14F4.quest_desc: [
		"When Powered by kinetics:"
		""
		"Starts rotating the attached structure towards the current hour. If an independent second structure exists in front of the first one, it will serve as the minute hand."
		""
		"The Value Settings Screen can be accessed from the side of the block, and can be used to change the order of the hands or switch to a 24-hour reading resembling the Clock item."
	]
	quest.17885EDA818D0013.quest_subtitle: "Throw black dye into the &6fire&f"
	quest.1791387CE7704B68.quest_desc: ["&dMystical&f &7armor&f starter tiers might not be the best, but the final tiers are probably top tier!"]
	quest.1791387CE7704B68.quest_subtitle: "Great Equipment!"
	quest.1791387CE7704B68.title: "Supremium &7Armor&f"
	quest.17B8176B307ADADC.quest_desc: ["This is your first &7chalk&f, use it to draw on the ground to cast the &dspells&f!"]
	quest.17B8176B307ADADC.quest_subtitle: "Our First Chalk"
	quest.17CB37C57A9748BA.quest_desc: ["With this new staff we can imitate a &1warden&f and release a &1sonic blast&f."]
	quest.17CB37C57A9748BA.quest_subtitle: "&1Sonic Blast&f"
	quest.180206DDBD6B2D59.quest_desc: [
		"The Pattern Encoding Terminal is similar to a regular terminal, with all the same settings and sections, but with an added pattern encoding interface. It looks similar to a crafting terminal's UI but this crafting grid doesn't actually perform crafts."
		""
		"You should have one of these in addition to a crafting terminal."
	]
	quest.180E388E97FDA200.quest_desc: ["This &csword&f is from a mod that adds several new swords, and there is nothing simple about them! Explore them all."]
	quest.180E388E97FDA200.quest_subtitle: "Simply &cSwords&f"
	quest.1837076B0EA3C11A.quest_desc: [
		"A &9Mechanical&f Belt is a mechanical component that conveys rotation and moves items and entities."
		""
		"Placing a Belt requires at least two Shafts. Place the Belt by right-clicking on the first shaft and then right clicking the second. Regardless of the length, this only consumes one mechanical belt. Both shafts must face the same direction."
		""
		"A Mechanical Belt can be placed over any number of Shafts arranged horizontally, vertically, or diagonally (45° towards the y axis) in a single line, provided that no obstructions are present and that the total length is no longer than twenty blocks. The Mechanical Belt also require that the two shafts face the same direction."
	]
	quest.189314C464890570.quest_subtitle: "Level 10"
	quest.189607EFA4AADBEC.quest_desc: [
		"The Crafting Grid allows access to resources stored in the storage &9network&f and crafting with them."
		""
		"You can insert and extract resources in the storage network inside the Grid."
	]
	quest.18A0677BF430A702.quest_subtitle: "Gold -> &bDiamond&f"
	quest.18D88932916C7A98.quest_desc: [
		"Electrolytic Separator"
		""
		"The Electrolytic Separator sends controlled amounts of direct current into a &3fluid&f, breaking the bonds between its atoms. This process, known as electrolysis, allows you to produce useful gases from ordinary &3liquids&f."
		""
		"As the fluid is electrolyzed, the resulting &3gases&f are stored in the machine’s internal tanks. If either tank becomes full, the Separator will &9automatically&f shut down. To keep it running, connect Pressurized Tubes or any compatible gas transport system to both tanks."
		""
		"If you only need one type of gas, you can set the unused gas output to Dump to vent it into the environment. This prevents the &9machine&f from stopping when a tank fills up."
		""
		"You’ll need several of these if you plan to build a Tier 2 Ore Processing Factory later on. For now, start by creating one and using it to electrolyze the most basic fluid: Water."
	]
	quest.18D88932916C7A98.quest_subtitle: "Time to Break It Down"
	quest.18DF3FB12E590D85.quest_desc: ["This &dsigil&f is used in the Reforging Table to make it work!"]
	quest.18DF3FB12E590D85.quest_subtitle: "PHOENIX"
	quest.18E2ACD4D73C21B2.quest_subtitle: "&6Fire&f School Armor"
	quest.18E2ACD4D73C21B2.title: "Pyromancer &7Armor&f"
	quest.18F1199ED3DA0CCA.quest_desc: [
		"WE MADE IT!"
		""
		"Okay, maybe it is &abetter&f to keep quiet..."
		""
		"There seem to be new creatures here and all of them are cousins of the &1warden&f, which means? They all hate noise, walk slowly and do not make a sound!"
	]
	quest.18F1199ED3DA0CCA.quest_subtitle: "Invading!"
	quest.18F1199ED3DA0CCA.title: "Visit &1Otherside&f"
	quest.195729280394ABFB.quest_desc: [
		"The Osmium Compressor is used to &6create&f Refined Obsidian &7Ingots&f from Refined Obsidian Dust and Glowstone Ingots from Glowstone Dust."
		""
		"It fuses liquid Osmium (melted down Osmium Ingots placed in the machine's bottom slot) with the originating materials to create their corresponding ingots."
	]
	quest.199AA7E13B28302F.quest_desc: ["Use to command your Moa."]
	quest.199AA7E13B28302F.quest_subtitle: "Commanding the Moa"
	quest.1A5BE8579198CB2D.quest_desc: [
		"When you finally find oil in a chunk, you can &6create&f the pumpjack drill and then assemble the pumpjack."
		""
		"When powered with &eenergy&f, the pumpjack will drain oil in the chunk. Then, you can retrieve the oil in buckets!"
	]
	quest.1A5BE8579198CB2D.quest_subtitle: "Looking for Oil"
	quest.1A61ABEC34369F47.quest_desc: ["A gearshift that changes rotation direction unless powered."]
	quest.1A6E8D9F8C1DDE91.title: "{ftb\tquests.chapter.mystical_agriculture.quest1A6E8D9F8C1DDE91.title}"
	quest.1A7D9B32BD59417B.quest_desc: [
		"Mostly &bdecorative&r powered &elight&r source that can be attached to &9Fluix ME Glass Cable&r or other non dense cables."
		""
		"Also used as crafting &ningredient&r."
	]
	quest.1A830C39DF160DED.quest_desc: ["After defeating the Slider, it will drop a key. With this key, we can access a hidden chest located beneath its room!"]
	quest.1A830C39DF160DED.quest_subtitle: "First Key"
	quest.1AEBEB1F0CE4B6AD.quest_desc: ["This &9machine&f allows us to cool down components."]
	quest.1AEBEB1F0CE4B6AD.quest_subtitle: "Cooling"
	quest.1AEBFCD56E37DF8D.quest_desc: ["If you're thinking about traveling at great heights, you can't do it without these goggles—you need to go in style!"]
	quest.1AEBFCD56E37DF8D.quest_subtitle: "Good Googles"
	quest.1B04A295850D0F00.quest_desc: ["The Train Observer is used to detect passing Trains."]
	quest.1B65E8BE91A087DA.quest_desc: [
		"After placing a Chain Conveyor, they can be connected to other Chain Conveyors by right-clicking them with a Chain. The selection can be cleared by right-clicking the Chain Conveyor again. "
		""
		"The maximum distance at which chain conveyors can be placed is 32 blocks, can add 8 blocks to the side if it is 32 blocks away."
		""
		"The maximum angle at which chain conveyors can connect with elevation difference is 45°, this allows an approximate ratio of 2 horizontal blocks to one vertical block. the maximum possible straight slope is 30L by 14H center to center."
	]
	quest.1B6DDF50D00CBB31.quest_desc: [
		"This is the way how to obtain &3Steel&r in &dMekanism&r."
		""
		"A &3Steel Ingot&r is created by smelting &3Steel Dust&r in any type of furnace."
		""
		"Infusing &7Iron&r with &b&o10&r units of &0Carbon&r in a &eMetallurgic Infuser&r will give you &7Enriched Iron&r."
		""
		"Infusing the &7Enriched Iron&r with a further &b&o10&r units of &0Carbon&r will give you &3Steel Dust&r,"
		""
		"&3Steel&r is a major crafting component in a lot of recipes in Mekanism."
	]
	quest.1BBA1FA8489B3DFE.quest_desc: ["This small pollen ball can only be found in the Pollinated Fields biome. There is a thin layer of pollen on the ground in this biome; break it."]
	quest.1BBA1FA8489B3DFE.quest_subtitle: "Pollen!!"
	quest.1BD06AE82B2DF1B4.quest_desc: ["Unfortunately, our scientists are still trying to understand what happened to Mars after that storm."]
	quest.1BD06AE82B2DF1B4.quest_subtitle: "Our Neighbor Planet"
	quest.1BD06AE82B2DF1B4.title: "Mars"
	quest.1BFF243C25F39525.quest_desc: ["Incredible as it may seem, sometimes &bApplied&f has good tools, and this &csword&f is one of them!"]
	quest.1BFF243C25F39525.quest_subtitle: "AE2"
	quest.1C14C5EED8076080.title: "{ftb\tquests.chapter.mystical_agriculture.quest1C14C5EED8076080.title}"
	quest.1C7595C546E3ADF2.title: "{ftb\tquests.chapter.mystical_agriculture.quest1C7595C546E3ADF2.title}"
	quest.1C7873E1D47F9BEB.quest_desc: ["As you probably already know, &9Oritech&f is an incredible mod and even its tools are incredible! Take this one for example."]
	quest.1C7873E1D47F9BEB.quest_subtitle: "A Different &7Pickaxe&f"
	quest.1C846B85D2ECF436.quest_desc: ["These cute little critters are small wanderers and on &4death&f they drop &6leather&f and meat."]
	quest.1C846B85D2ECF436.quest_subtitle: "Big Legs"
	quest.1CB243F7E197B883.quest_desc: ["Displays the top level job and its current progress so you can see what a particular Crafting CPU is currently working on."]
	quest.1CD23C45BE9F62F6.quest_desc: ["Just kidding, you starving thing, this is not for eating."]
	quest.1CD23C45BE9F62F6.quest_subtitle: "Edible"
	quest.1D00D782B8F0B6D6.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Mechanical&f Mixer is powered by an internal cogwheel, and will behave as one to any adjacent components, relaying and reversing rotation sideways."
		""
		"The Mixer requires a minimum rotational speed of 30 RPM from its &epower&f source to work. Mixers will process ingredients &afaster&f the more speed it is given."
		""
		"To work, a Mixer must be placed directly above a Basin, with a 1 block gap. When a valid recipe is inserted by throwing the ingredients in the Mixer, the Mixer will automatically combine the ingredients."
	]
	quest.1D0939A8B41C72BF.quest_desc: [
		"Stores up to 200,000 AE."
		""
		"They do not accept &epower&f directly, but are used to add additional power storage to an already existing ME &9Network&f."
	]
	quest.1D197B1919452187.quest_desc: ["A compact &cRedstone&f Link that adds wireless redstone to buttons, levers, and linked levers."]
	quest.1DB62C546A76E5BC.quest_subtitle: "Fry the &2Food&f"
	quest.1DBA8DD396081924.quest_desc: ["The Interfaces must be placed facing each other at 1-2 blocks apart, one on a Contraption with &3Fluid&f Tanks and one stationary. A Fluid Pump is required to insert or extract &3liquid&f from the Contraption. To pump liquids to another tank, simply connect the stationary interface and the fluid tank with fluid pipes, although pumps are required to move the liquids."]
	quest.1DBBE83DBF93F37E.quest_subtitle: "Our Lightning &dMagic&f"
	quest.1E01AC22D5903AD1.quest_desc: ["Hand cranks with a cogwheel installed."]
	quest.1E07012AB77B51EC.quest_desc: ["This block works just like a reactor and allows us to build a structure by stacking these blocks to increase &agrowth&f &aspeed&f."]
	quest.1E07012AB77B51EC.quest_subtitle: "An &aImproved&f Dirt"
	quest.1E12F23E674ACFF1.quest_desc: [
		"The &2essence&f of fury is quite curious: it commands and you have no control."
		""
		"Place it in the off-hand and it will choose 4 mobs for you to kill, rewarding you with strength for doing so."
		""
		"Maximum up to level 16."
	]
	quest.1E12F23E674ACFF1.quest_subtitle: "Scaling in Strength"
	quest.1E4E718BB7A63EFD.quest_subtitle: "{ftb\tquests.chapter.mystical_agriculture.quest1E4E718BB7A63EFD.subtitle}"
	quest.1E4E718BB7A63EFD.title: "{ftb\tquests.chapter.mystical_agriculture.quest1E4E718BB7A63EFD.title}"
	quest.1E98E27F0BE78F09.quest_desc: [
		"We can find this compass in the drops of one of the 3 previous structures."
		""
		"It points to the nearest Throne Pillar."
	]
	quest.1E98E27F0BE78F09.quest_subtitle: "A New Compass"
	quest.1E9E11F072665A05.quest_desc: [
		"We need to start creating our car; we can use the Chain Drive to make the chassis, place the axle and wheels, the seats, and the Physics Assembler. Build the car without it being stuck to the ground."
		""
		"{image:\tquests:textures/car_example.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1E9E11F072665A05.quest_subtitle: "Bringing the car to &alife&f"
	quest.1EBA6436DEBB02CC.quest_desc: [
		"The &eME Conversion Monitor&r is the upgraded version of the &2ME Storage Monitor&r."
		""
		"It adds the ability to &ndirectly&r withdraw from or store &aItems&r into the &dME Network&r."
		""
		"In addition to the &2Storage Monitor's&r interactions, conversion monitors support the following actions:"
		""
		"&bLeft-click&r &nExtracts&r a stack of the shown item into &nyour inventory&r"
		""
		"&bRight-click&r with &eItem&r &nInserts&r the held item into &nthe network&r"
		""
		"&bRight-click&r with &7Empty Hand&r will &ninsert&r all of the shown item from &nyour inventory&r into &nthe network&r."
	]
	quest.1F6283A843E4F6D6.quest_desc: ["Let's start with basic materials. Start by crafting Quartz Enriched &7Iron&f and Processor Binding. You will need them to start your digital storage &9system&f!"]
	quest.1FB657F4DEC4885C.quest_desc: ["Crafting Storage provides 1k - 265M of storage for crafting."]
	quest.1FC7E9DBF92BE6AA.quest_desc: ["The &eEnergy&f Tablet is a portable, rechargeable battery pack that can be charged with up to 1,000kJ of energy and can then be used to &epower&f other devices. It is also an ingredient in many recipes."]
	quest.1FCFAE491EF9E348.title: "{ftb\tquests.chapter.mystical_agriculture.quest1FCFAE491EF9E348.title}"
	quest.1FDBB75ECD39FB24.quest_desc: [
		"The Item Drain can hold up to 1500mb of &3fluid&f at a time. A Fluid Pump is needed to extract the fluid."
		""
		"A Basin will &9automatically&f deposit output fluids into an Item Drain placed near it."
	]
	quest.2047CD5BA224D2C7.quest_subtitle: "Cook Ores &9Automatically&f"
	quest.206DF670E637F6D8.quest_subtitle: "Tier 5"
	quest.20A3C61435DF84EE.quest_desc: ["We can build new tools whenever we reach a new &2seed&f tier in &dMystical&f, always getting stronger!"]
	quest.20A3C61435DF84EE.quest_subtitle: "New Tools"
	quest.20A3C61435DF84EE.title: "Prudentium Tools"
	quest.20DA1FC703F9B4FE.quest_desc: [
		""
		""
		"{entity:minecraft:warden ent_size:1.0 off_x:0.0 off_y:0.0 rot:0.0 spin:FORCE_OFF idle:FORCE_OFF walk:FORCE_ON width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.20DA1FC703F9B4FE.quest_subtitle: "Kill &1Warden&f"
	quest.20DA1FC703F9B4FE.title: "&1Warden&f"
	quest.21355027240AAB0A.quest_desc: ["Hello explorer, I know you must be mega curious to know how aeronautics works, I am too! let's &alearn&f together to &6create&f ships, planes, cars, balloons and much more!"]
	quest.21355027240AAB0A.quest_subtitle: "Playing with physics"
	quest.21355027240AAB0A.title: "&6Create&f Aeronautics"
	quest.213EB117D0E67DCD.quest_desc: ["We can craft new &1warden&f gear, and it is way stronger than our &8netherite&f gear!"]
	quest.213EB117D0E67DCD.quest_subtitle: "New &1Warden&f Gear"
	quest.213EB117D0E67DCD.title: "&1Warden&f Tools"
	quest.21696AFEAB2AC52F.quest_subtitle: "Level 5"
	quest.218230A39A18F621.quest_subtitle: "Your backpack becomes indestructible"
	quest.2192DB99EC17807E.title: "{ftb\tquests.chapter.mystical_agriculture.quest2192DB99EC17807E.title}"
	quest.21A830CC8DAD6566.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click a Train Track, then place the Station within 15 blocks of the track. It can only &6create&f Trains if placed on a straight Track, and Bogeys may only be placed on a 3 block long straight track."
		""
		"In the interface, the Station can be named; these names are how non-player conducted Trains will identify stations. A conductor cannot be instructed to navigate to a station that is named the same as the station they are currently at, and will otherwise choose the closest accessible station out of multiple stations with the same name."
		""
		"The name will also show up on a Map if it is used on the station, similarly to Banners."
	]
	quest.21B40BEC30B40491.quest_desc: [
		"While held, funnels prevent the player from accessing inventories, instead placing them. Sneak right clicking with a Funnel places it in input mode."
		""
		"Using a Wrench on the funnel switches it between input and output mode. &cRedstone&f can be applied to stop the funnel from inputting or outputting. Right-clicking a funnel on a &9Mechanical&f Belt causes it to extend one block forward."
	]
	quest.21B40BEC30B40491.title: "Funnel"
	quest.21C7AA9059B16A83.quest_desc: ["It's this... it launches potatoes... what else did you think it would do? honestly..."]
	quest.21C7AA9059B16A83.quest_subtitle: "Potato Launcher"
	quest.21E7F21EDBFE930F.quest_desc: [
		"With all these new mods, even I don't know what to expect from the &4nether&f..."
		""
		"Let's grab a bit of gold and make a piece of &6golden&f gear to protect ourselves."
	]
	quest.21E7F21EDBFE930F.quest_subtitle: "The &4Nether&f is Crazy"
	quest.21E7F21EDBFE930F.title: "&6Gold&f Nugget"
	quest.220EBF75C940C7CF.quest_desc: [
		"The Controller powers the storage &9network&f."
		""
		"Refined Storage is an alternative option for those not used to Applied!"
		""
		"Each network requires at least one Controller to stay active. Multiple Controllers can be used to fulfill higher &eenergy&f demands."
		""
		"Other 2 Refined storage &9machines&f need to be connected to the controller, either by cable or simply touching the controller or any other machine connected to it."
	]
	quest.220EBF75C940C7CF.quest_subtitle: "&9System&f Startup"
	quest.220EBF75C940C7CF.title: "Controller"
	quest.222848091DA64418.quest_desc: ["&dMystical&f &7armor&f starter tiers might not be the best, but the final tiers are probably top tier!"]
	quest.222848091DA64418.quest_subtitle: "Great Equipment!"
	quest.222848091DA64418.title: "Tertium &7Armor&f"
	quest.225BFD805A1596F1.quest_desc: ["This &csword&f is very strong! But to get it, we need to go to a &cdangerous&f and gross dimension."]
	quest.225BFD805A1596F1.quest_subtitle: "&cSword&f of the Mud"
	quest.22A6A63C3A92B339.quest_subtitle: "Holy School &7Armor&f"
	quest.22A6A63C3A92B339.title: "Shadow-Walker &7Armor&f"
	quest.22C5AC7E54588345.quest_desc: ["This strange creature hides very powerful &7armor&f inside its body, and they &cattack&f without mercy!"]
	quest.22C5AC7E54588345.quest_subtitle: "A Bizarre Creature"
	quest.22DF0048CEBB51AB.quest_desc: ["This is an &7armor&f we get by traveling to the beloved &bAether&f! It is pretty basic."]
	quest.22DF0048CEBB51AB.quest_subtitle: "Going to the &bAether&f"
	quest.22DF0048CEBB51AB.title: "Gravitite &7Armor&f"
	quest.22EAF1B9A184CDF4.quest_desc: ["We can &6create&f new types of dirt to speed up the seed &agrowth&f process."]
	quest.22EAF1B9A184CDF4.quest_subtitle: "An &aImproved&f Dirt"
	quest.2392C2C14D5BB289.quest_desc: ["Repair with &6golden&f apples."]
	quest.2392C2C14D5BB289.quest_subtitle: "Summon Shields to Protect You"
	quest.23A9A2D399A7BF94.quest_desc: [
		"The Elevator Pulley moves much like the Rope Pulley and shares certain functionalities. Unlike the Rope Pulley, it can phase through blocks, and will not turn back into blocks unless the Pulley is right-clicked."
		""
		"An Elevator Pulley requires a single horizontal &cRedstone&f Contact to be on the contraption in order to assemble. If more than one is added, the Elevator will not assemble. If either of these conditions are not met, a corresponding error message will be displayed while looking at the Elevator Pulley."
	]
	quest.23AB56019F9EC047.quest_desc: ["Okay, it's not a recipe, but almost... use 3 &4wither&f skulls + soul sand to spawn this feared &4Boss&f."]
	quest.23AB56019F9EC047.quest_subtitle: "Crafting a &4Wither&f"
	quest.23AB56019F9EC047.title: "&4Wither&f Skeleton Skull"
	quest.23CFF3A7D29E7398.quest_desc: [
		"Lost in the swamp, we can find the entrance to the Minotaur mini-&4boss&f labyrinth."
		""
		"Navigate through the entire labyrinth and find the Minotaur. His fight is much simpler, but stay cautious!"
		""
		"{entity:twilightforest:minotaur ent_size:1.0 off_x:0.0 off_y:0.0 rot:0.0 spin:FORCE_OFF idle:FORCE_OFF walk:FORCE_ON width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.23CFF3A7D29E7398.quest_subtitle: "Labyrinth Mini-&4Boss&f"
	quest.23EAABD5221EB3ED.title: "{ftb\tquests.chapter.mystical_agriculture.quest23EAABD5221EB3ED.title}"
	quest.2463DBE1B4A60721.quest_desc: [
		"This sanctuary was built in an improper place and flooded, but not forgotten..."
		""
		"On the contrary, inside the sanctuary we can find guards... but that's not the biggest problem."
		""
		"Real problem: &3WATER&f! Hold your breath and fight several monsters until all are dead."
	]
	quest.2463DBE1B4A60721.quest_subtitle: "Aquatic Challenge!"
	quest.2498A384875D3E6A.quest_desc: ["This &7axe&f is very good, but getting it is pretty gross; we need to travel to a very gross &5dimension&f..."]
	quest.2498A384875D3E6A.quest_subtitle: "Gross &7Axe&f"
	quest.24CFA0022432887E.quest_desc: [
		"When placed by the player, the Threshold Switch will attempt to orient itself toward an adjacent inventory. If multiple or no inventories are present, the Threshold Switch may orient itself toward the player and can be adjusted as normal using the &aWrench&f. At present, it cannot be oriented vertically."
		""
		"Item thresholds can be set to determine when the &credstone&f signal turns on or off. When the Switch is first placed, it stays off until it reaches 75% inventory, then stays on until it reaches 25% inventory."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The chest icon represents how full the inventory is, as well as the current signal state (on/off) depending on which lane the chest icon is in. The arrows represent inventory thresholds, illustrated by the chest icon switching lanes upon reaching the arrow."
		""
		"The signal can be inverted by clicking the button showing two opposing arrows next to the lower threshold bar."
	]
	quest.24DDED464AE48E05.quest_desc: ["Reverses outgoing Rotational Force when a &cRedstone&f signal is applied."]
	quest.25044B7143B3BBA9.quest_desc: ["Does it increase xp? Or is it just decorative?"]
	quest.25044B7143B3BBA9.quest_subtitle: "XP?"
	quest.250B7E1D42AF4FFB.quest_desc: ["{entity:minecraft:wither ent_size:1.0 off_x:0.0 off_y:0.0 rot:0.0 spin:FORCE_OFF idle:FORCE_OFF walk:FORCE_ON width:100 height:100 align:center}"]
	quest.250B7E1D42AF4FFB.quest_subtitle: "Kill &4Wither&f"
	quest.250B7E1D42AF4FFB.title: "&4Wither&f"
	quest.255692048E04D933.quest_subtitle: "Add Range"
	quest.2572CE9AFE32C5FB.quest_desc: [
		"Find and kill a &1Sculk Leech&f; this little critter can suck out our whole &5soul&f!"
		""
		"They can come out of broken ancient pots!"
	]
	quest.2572CE9AFE32C5FB.quest_subtitle: "An Atypical Monster"
	quest.2579E4AF76FE7B94.quest_desc: ["We can generate &bmana&f in our mod with potions! Each type of potion increases the generated amount and potion complexity also impacts it!"]
	quest.2579E4AF76FE7B94.quest_subtitle: "Generating with Potions"
	quest.25A569FA372DAF29.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you've done everything, it's time to face it... the FINAL &4BOSS&f or almost that... but it's still fun and that's what matters."
		""
		"{entity:minecraft:ender_dragon ent_size:1.0 off_x:0.0 off_y:0.0 rot:0.0 spin:USE_GLOBAL idle:FORCE_OFF walk:FORCE_OFF width:200 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.25A569FA372DAF29.quest_subtitle: "Slaying the Beast"
	quest.25A569FA372DAF29.title: "&5Ender Dragon&f"
	quest.25A7B7E77FA09F80.quest_desc: ["In this mod there is something very &eimportant&f which is amethyst! This wand when clicked points out amethyst geodes around you! Incredible, right?"]
	quest.25A7B7E77FA09F80.quest_subtitle: "Locating"
	quest.25C93EDEDDF8CBE4.quest_desc: [
		"The &2Toggle Bus&r."
		""
		"A bus which functions similarly to &9Fluix ME Glass Cable&r or other &eCables&r, but it &nallows&r its connection state to be toggled via &credstone&r."
		""
		"This allows you to &ncut off&r a section of an &dME Network&r."
	]
	quest.260B5D2F0C553BA0.quest_desc: [
		"&dMystical Agriculture&f is an incredible mod that allows us to have &2crop&f farms of ores, drops, and much more! It's an amazing mod."
		""
		"We can start with the prosperity shard, which can be found in caves!"
	]
	quest.260B5D2F0C553BA0.quest_subtitle: "&dMystical Agriculture&f"
	quest.261ABBDC3DABD8B3.quest_desc: ["A clutch that is only coupled if the input spins in the correct direction as configured."]
	quest.263220DCCDB90E29.quest_desc: [
		"So far, to double your &7ingot&f output, your setup should look something like this:"
		""
		"Raw ores go into the Purification Chamber, which receives &3Oxygen&f from an Electrolytic Separator."
		"The processed material is then sent to the Crusher, which turns the ore clumps into Dirty &7Dust&f."
		"Next, the Dirty Dust is fed into an Enrichment Chamber, refining it into regular Ore Dust."
		"Finally, the Ore Dust is sent into a Smelter, producing your ingots."
		""
		"This &9system&f completes the Tier 2 ore processing chain, giving you twice the output from every ore."
	]
	quest.26A58E2711BC7B28.quest_desc: [
		"The Spatial IO Port is used in spatial IO to hold the spatial cell and control the spatial IO operation."
		""
		"The cell can be inserted and extracted by any item logistics like hoppers or ae2 busses, if you want to &9automate&f it."
	]
	quest.26B4A0B315CE1F99.quest_desc: ["This &7shovel&f is really good at digging blocks, seriously... incredible as it sounds."]
	quest.26B4A0B315CE1F99.quest_subtitle: "This One Digs Blocks"
	quest.270E0BC2E8565FFE.quest_desc: [
		"Pulls items from the inventory it is pointed at and places them into the &dME Network's&r Networked Storage."
		""
		"You can &nspecify&r which items it will pull out via the &bUI&r, else it tries to pull out any item in the adjacent inventory."
		""
		"The &aME Import Bus&r will attempt to import any possible options, even if &o1&r or more of the &nconfigured&r items cannot be stored."
		""
		"The &aME Import Bus&r requires a &eChannel&r to function."
		""
		"This is the functional opposite of the &6ME Export Bus&r."
	]
	quest.271772621B5591F3.quest_subtitle: "Copper -> &7Iron&f"
	quest.27667B139631FDB6.quest_desc: ["This new monster shows up absolutely everywhere!"]
	quest.27667B139631FDB6.quest_subtitle: "This World Zombie"
	quest.2773094F7FCBCA33.quest_subtitle: "THE BEST"
	quest.27C45A69B7025251.quest_desc: ["Welcome to the new world! Maybe you already know it, but for those who don't, &cbeware&f! You might fall in love."]
	quest.27C45A69B7025251.quest_subtitle: "Entering the &5Dimension&f"
	quest.27C45A69B7025251.title: "Visit &2Twilight Forest&f"
	quest.2802BFD27853F3F6.quest_desc: ["Here we start getting &abetter&f gear. The rare tier is a big step up and it shows up in every &eworld tier&f."]
	quest.2802BFD27853F3F6.quest_subtitle: "Rare"
	quest.28290AF3FAD08B11.quest_desc: ["Okay, maybe these aren't as friendly as villagers... but they make great trades, they carry &6gold&f! Maybe they are Portuguese..."]
	quest.28290AF3FAD08B11.quest_subtitle: "Trading in the &4Nether&f"
	quest.28290AF3FAD08B11.title: "Bastion"
	quest.282D7D83EF4ACE88.quest_subtitle: "Our Evocation &dMagic&f"
	quest.28554729ADB09254.quest_desc: ["In our modpack we have several new tools that we can use."]
	quest.28554729ADB09254.quest_subtitle: "Incredible New Tools"
	quest.28554729ADB09254.title: "Tools"
	quest.28586493542A3B3A.quest_desc: [
		"{ftb\tquests.chapter.mystical_agriculture.quest28586493542A3B3A.description1}"
		""
